			(at 38.1 139.7 0)
			(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right) (hide yes))
		)
	)
	(text "Soft-touch momentary switch on the panel, wired to a 2-pin\nJST PH connector.  Read by the firmware; C42 filters\nnoise picked up on the switch wires."
